[node name="LooksRadio" type="Node3D" unique_id=1145435939]
editor_description = "assets/28: the Radio's Looks (tv-and-radio.md, Looks contracts): the old radio at 1.5 times its modelled size (R1), the origin at the bottom centre, the front +Z. Clips: on / off (the dial's and the power lamp's warm glow, at once, as the old), dial (the needle's whole travel, 0.09 m of the model, linear over 1 s: the knob seeks a channel's mark at dial / channels and plays the section between two marks, eased, over the static's time)."

